# Datarim workflow state (local-only)
datarim/

# Rust
/target/
code/target/
**/target/
dist/
**/dist/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
# ...except the shipped CLI's lock: builds must resolve one graph, not re-resolve
# live crates.io on every job (the negation must follow the Cargo.lock line).
!code/cubrim-rs/Cargo.lock
# ...and the web-profile CLI's, for a sharper reason: the benchmark harness
# attributes a measurement to a binary by sha256, so a build whose dependency
# graph can drift under it cannot carry provenance.
!code/cubrim-web-cli/Cargo.lock

# Python prototyping
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Benchmark corpora (large binaries — keep generators, not data)
# The 10 corpus fixtures are committed: crate tests assert on them, so a
# fresh clone must carry them (they are ~122 KB, deterministic from seeded
# generators, and were regenerated bit-identically to the recorded sha256s).
# The manifest stays local — its `path` entries are machine-absolute and the
# research probes that read them run on the machine that generated it.
documentation/ephemeral/research/corpus/manifest.json
*.bin
# ...except the 10 committed test fixtures (the negation must follow *.bin):
!documentation/ephemeral/research/corpus/*.bin
*.cube

# Transient bench outputs written by the gates / loop (regenerated each run)
documentation/ephemeral/research/gate-ratio-candidate-bench.json
documentation/ephemeral/research/gate-ratio-candidate-report.md
documentation/ephemeral/research/probe-*-bench.json
documentation/ephemeral/research/probe-*-report.md

# Cubrim Web Benchmark generated evidence and void journal
bench/web-benchmark/out/
bench/web-benchmark/journal/

# Cluster secrets (never commit)
code/cluster/*.env
code/cluster/.env*
code/cluster/infra/.env
code/cluster/infra/env/orchestrator.env
code/cluster/infra/env/worker-a.env
code/cluster/infra/env/worker-b.env
code/cluster/infra/env/worker-c.env
*.env
.env*
cluster.env

# Consilium runtime drafts (gitignored — voice-bearing, not reviewed)
datarim/pub-consilium/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
cm_scope
*.log
